The only way I was able to install it was with the mac os pre-installed python in /usr/bin/python. I think it will also work if you compile python yourself. Basically, I installed rpy2 with the pre-installed python 2.6  and moved the rpy folder in site-packages to a location on my PYTHONPATH. That worked for me.

Yair 

